#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Unified Document & Thai OCR Extractor for PDF, DOCX, XLSX, PPTX, ZIP, and Images.

Enforces a shared ExtractionBudget across the entire document tree (including nested ZIPs):
- Pre-checks declared member sizes and enforces streamed byte ceilings during actual decompression.
- Bounds nested archive depth, total member count, per-entry bytes, cumulative extracted bytes,
  spreadsheet rows, PDF pages, and cumulative extracted text output characters.
- Evaluates both cached and uncached XLSX formulas (SUM, AVERAGE, MIN, MAX, COUNT, cross-sheet refs, arithmetic).
- Provides stdlib OpenXML fallbacks for DOCX, XLSX, and PPTX when optional Python packages are absent.
- Distinguishes budget_exceeded, encrypted_document, unsupported_format, corrupt_or_invalid_document,
  parser_unavailable, and file_not_found; never silently omits pages, rows, or failed archive members.
"""

